        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyvinylbutyral foil, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyvinylbutyral foil, at plant
The foil consists of 70% PVB and 30% plasticizer. Wastes are recycled internally.;
UUID: 7e10da3a-bd18-3858-9058-b61ae887691a
Included is polyvinylbutyral and a plasticizer which is commonly used in PVB sheets. Extrusion process and transports of raw materials are included as well.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Extrusion of PVB and plasticizer to sheets.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature and industry data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7e10da3a-bd18-3858-9058-b61ae887691a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
